{title: 020 - O Praise Ye the Lord}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Worship}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[F]O praise [Bb]ye the [Cm/Eb]Lord!
[F]Praise [Bb/D]Him [Eb]in [Cm]the [F7]height;
[Bb]Rejoice [Gm]in [F/A]His word,
[Bb/D]Ye [F]angels [Bb]of [Cm]light;
[F7/Eb]Ye [Gm/D]heavens, [Eb]adore [Dm]Him
[Bb/D]By whom [Cm/Eb]ye were [F]made,
[F7/Eb]And [Dm]worship [Gm]before [Cm]Him,
[Bb/F]In brightness arrayed.

Verse 2:
[F]O praise [Bb]ye the [Cm/Eb]Lord!
[F]Praise [Bb/D]Him [Eb]upon [F7]earth,
[Bb]In tuneful [F/A]accord:
[Bb/D]Ye [F]sons [Adim]of [Bb]new [Cm]birth;
[F7/Eb]Praise [Cm]Him [Eb]who hath [Dm]brought
[Bb/D]you His [Cm/Eb]grace from [F]above,
[F7/Eb]Praise [Dm]Him [D/Gb]who [Gm]hath [Cm]taught
[Bb/F]you To [F7]sing of [Bb]His love.

Verse 3:
[F]O praise [Bb]ye the [Cm/Eb]Lord,
[F]All [Bb/D]things [Eb]that [Cm]give [F7]sound;
[Bb]Each jubilant [F/A]chord,
[Bb/D]Re-echo around;
[F7/Eb]Loud [Gm/D]organs [Eb]His glory
[Bb/D]Forth tell [Cm/Eb]in deep [F]tone,
[F7/Eb]And [Dm]sweet [D/Gb]harp, [Gm]the story
[Bb/F]Of what [F7]He hath [Bb]done.

Verse 4:
[F]O praise [Bb]ye the [Cm/Eb]Lord!
[F]Thanksgiving [Cm]and [F7]song
[Bb]To Him [Gm]be [F/A]outpoured
[Bb/D]All [F]ages [Bb]along:
[F7/Eb]For [Cm]love [Eb]in creation,
[Bb/D]For heaven [Cm/Eb]restored.
[F7/Eb]For [Dm]grace [D/Gb]of [Gm]salvation,
[Bb/F]O praise [F7]ye the [Bb]Lord!
